# This template ships intentionally empty. Real DocuClick sessions write
# notes/canvases/docs and screenshots into Prozesse/ — keep those out of
# git so a live-in-place vault never leaks captured content into this
# public repo (see VaultTemplate/README.md: copy this folder out first).
/Prozesse/*
!/Prozesse/.gitkeep
!/Prozesse/Attachments
/Prozesse/Attachments/*
!/Prozesse/Attachments/.gitkeep

# Obsidian's local workspace/cache state, not template content.
.obsidian/
